      "name": "Retributive Strike",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger An enemy damages one of Lomok's allies, and both combatants are within 15 feet of him\n\n---\nEffect Lomok shields his ally and calls for retribution upon the attacker. The ally reduces the triggering damage by 13. Lomok and any allies within reach of the triggering enemy can make melee Strikes against it."
    },
