      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Shield Block",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger While you have your shield raised, you would take damage from a physical attack\n\n---\n\nYou snap your shield in place to ward off a blow. Your shield prevents you from taking an amount of damage up to the shield's Hardness. You and the shield each take any remaining damage, possibly breaking or destroying the shield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
